$indicator_(A union B) = 1 - indicator_(X \\ (X \\ A union B)) = 1 - indicator_(A^(complement) inter B^(complement)) = 1 - indicator_(A^(complement)) indicator_(B^(complement)) = 1 - (1 - indicator_A)(1 - indicator_B) = indicator_A + indicator_B - indicator_(A inter B)$, using the De Morgan identity $A^(complement) inter B^(complement) = (A union B)^(complement)$ and multiplicativity on intersections.
